%% enterprise-agent-control-plane — baseline vs governed control plane
%% Source for the README architecture diagram and external embeds (issue #53).
%% Render with the Mermaid CLI: mmdc -i architecture.mmd -o architecture.svg
flowchart LR
    U[Support Operator] --> B[Unsafe Baseline Agent]
    U --> G[Governed Agent Control Plane]

    subgraph Baseline [Unsafe baseline]
        B --> T1[Full tool catalog every step]
        B --> R1[Raw tool outputs in context]
        B --> W1[Policy-blind writes]
    end

    subgraph Governed [Governed control plane]
        G --> CW[contextweaver: bounded shortlist]
        CW --> CH[ChainWeaver: deterministic flow]
        CH --> AK[agent-kernel: capability tokens + Frames]
        AK --> AF[AgentFence: allow/deny/ask gate]
        AF --> AU[agent-kernel: audit trace]
        AU --> EV[skdr-eval: offline comparison]
        EV --> LW[lessonweaver: reviewed lessons]
    end
